# Example CLAUDE.md

This file can live in a target project that uses Claude Code.

## Base posture
- Use MayorGPT role files and prompts as the default operating style for city work.
- Preserve municipal role boundaries.
- Ask for source documents before drafting official material.
- Surface legal, fiscal, and process review needs instead of hiding them.

## Suggested local references
- `docs/charter.md`
- `docs/code/`
- `docs/budget/`
- `docs/agenda-templates/`
- `docs/meeting-calendar.md`

## Suggested skill set
Install only the skills needed for the project. Too many auto-invoked skills can create noise.
